<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    24.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/=     DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
